source: crates/leptoskit_admin/tests/analytics.rs
expression: screen(html)
---
main [main]
  div [notice] role=status
  "Learn"
  "Short lessons that check your real project, not a quiz."
  div [progress-mark] role=img label="Your mark: 0 of 3 pieces"
  "4 down. 7 to go."
  span [progress]
    "Finish a track and a piece of the mark lands. Analytics 3 of 6 · Infrastructure 1 of 5"
  div [up-next]
    "Up next"
    "5 min · Infrastructure"
    "Plan, review, apply"
    "A plan compares [infra] with what exists and lists the difference; it changes nothing. You read the rows, and Apply runs exactly that plan, refusing it if anything moved underneath. Deleting what keeps data is blocked outright."
    "• Check: you applied a plan"
    a label="Continue in notes-production" href=/_leptoskit/admin/infra/projects/notes-production/changes
      "Continue in notes-production"
    a label="Read it here instead" href=/_leptoskit/admin/learn/infrastructure/plan-review-apply
      "Read it here instead"
    "This lesson ticks itself once it's true of your data."
  div [grid-main]
    "Analytics"
    "3/6"
    a [lesson:first-typed-event] label="Your first typed event: done" href=/_leptoskit/admin/learn/analytics/first-typed-event
